{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488011-titanic-scions-chosen-by-gods","id":1488011,"title":"Titanic scions chosen by gods","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-26T06:16:35-07:00","id":1488011,"title":"Titanic scions chosen by gods","content":"Is it possible for a Titanic Scion to become chosen (adopted) by a god? And will he be ruled as Titanic or normal Scion then.<br /> For example, a Child of Su Daji will be chosen by Inari. Does the Character has to take a Titanic Calling and becomes the epicenter of Purviews or does he has the normal rules for a scion of Inari?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T12:45:51-07:00","id":1488076,"title":"","content":"There was a half human half dragon creature adopted by Athena. I'll have to look up his name. He'd be an example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T14:38:07-07:00","id":1488091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lykas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488011-titanic-scions-chosen-by-gods#post1488011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it possible for a Titanic Scion to become chosen (adopted) by a god? And will he be ruled as Titanic or normal Scion then.<br /> For example, a Child of Su Daji will be chosen by Inari. Does the Character has to take a Titanic Calling and becomes the epicenter of Purviews or does he has the normal rules for a scion of Inari?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So this is a super unique edge case sort of thing that should honestly be hammered out by the player and storyguide, and reflect what you want to do with the character.<br /> <br /> TBH my knee-jerk thought is to treat them as a Titanic Scion, as the immediately-presented story is someone whose nature and adopted parentage may be at odds. There'd individual settings to adjust there; I'd push harder for them to retain Epicenters than I would say such a character must have Titanic callings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T17:27:52-07:00","id":1488115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lykas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488011-titanic-scions-chosen-by-gods#post1488011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it possible for a Titanic Scion to become chosen (adopted) by a god? And will he be ruled as Titanic or normal Scion then.<br /> For example, a Child of Su Daji will be chosen by Inari. Does the Character has to take a Titanic Calling and becomes the epicenter of Purviews or does he has the normal rules for a scion of Inari?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd see what the player wants and go with that.Long as you are not worried about powergaming I guess.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-