 <div class=\"message\">Erichthonious was born of the earth. Sperm was cast down on the Earth after an attempted rape and Athena adopted the child. The Earth (Gaia) is a Titan. So Athena adopted a Titanic Scion.<br /> <br /> It's a precedent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Although he was equal parts titianic and olympian. So one could argue his Olympian heritage was dominant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-27T02:02:38-07:00","id":1488147,"title":"","content":"I would say there is n reason to not have the complete Titanic Calling. Ares has it (if you allow in your campaign) and he is son of 2 gods (or a godess by herself, if you read different sources).<br /> <br /> It would be really interesting to play a Scion with the powers of a Titanic Scion and trying to avoid chaos and destruction...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"li